    {"datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"}, "id": 27, "type": "table", "title": "Usage per client in the selected range (up to 30 days)", "description": "From the poller's per-minute usage lines in Loki, which keeps 30 days; set the time picker up to 30 days. Older history is in the ledger on skullsaints (tplink-router-poll.py --report day) and its nightly copy on ubuntu-dev. Includes traffic a client already had on its counter when first seen (kind=carried).", "gridPos": {"h": 10, "w": 10, "x": 0, "y": 62}, "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "custom": {"align": "auto", "cellOptions": {"type": "auto"}}}, "overrides": [{"matcher": {"id": "byRegexp", "options": "Download|Upload|Total"}, "properties": [{"id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": {"type": "gauge", "mode": "basic"}}]}]}, "options": {"showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{"displayName": "Total", "desc": true}], "footer": {"show": true, "reducer": ["sum"], "fields": ""}}, "targets": [{"datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"}, "expr": "sum by (name, mac) (sum_over_time({host=\"skullsaints\", unit=\"tplink-router-poll.service\"} |~ \"^usage \" | logfmt | unwrap download_bytes [$__range]))", "refId": "A", "queryType": "instant"}, {"datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"}, "expr": "sum by (name, mac) (sum_over_time({host=\"skullsaints\", unit=\"tplink-router-poll.service\"} |~ \"^usage \" | logfmt | unwrap upload_bytes [$__range]))", "refId": "B", "queryType": "instant"}], "transformations": [{"id": "merge", "options": {}}, {"id": "organize", "options": {"excludeByName": {"Time": true}, "renameByName": {"name": "Client", "mac": "MAC", "Value #A": "Download", "Value #B": "Upload"}, "indexByName": {"name": 0, "mac": 1, "Value #A": 2, "Value #B": 3}}}, {"id": "calculateField", "options": {"mode": "binary", "binary": {"left": "Download", "operator": "+", "right": "Upload"}, "alias": "Total", "replaceFields": false}}]},
